DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260608T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260608T170000
UID:695d7c476f926136000eadfa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously s
 upported\, in part\, by donors.\nPlease note that in May\, ASC will be on
  May 5\, 12\, and 19\, returning to Mondays on May 25.
LOCATION:Barbara Frum\, 1st Floor Children's Tables
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/695d7c476f926136000eadfa
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
