 and skill level are welcomed to participate in the club. Chess introductio
 n lessons are available for new players that are new to the game. The prog
 ram is for\nchildren ages 7+\, teens\, and adults\n. For More Information\
 , please call the Guildwood Library at 416-396-8872.\nDrop-In. No registra
 tion required.\nIf you identify as a person with a disability and require 
 an accessibility accommodation to participate in this program\, please con
 tact Accessibility Services by email\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voic
 email\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please contact us at least three
  weeks in advance.
